<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora{% endif %}">NEVORA</a></p><h1 class="t1 rise">NEVORA support</h1><p class="lede fade">Get help with NEVORA, a workforce scheduling and operations product of VELANI LLC.</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#p-0">Contact support</a><a href="#p-1">Questions about your work</a><a href="#p-2">Signing in</a><a href="#p-3">Privacy and account deletion</a><a href="#p-4">Reporting content</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">Also for NEVORA</p><nav aria-label="Other NEVORA pages"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-terms{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-terms{% endif %}">NEVORA terms of use</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-account-deletion{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-account-deletion{% endif %}">Delete your NEVORA account</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="p-0"><i>01</i><h2>Contact support</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> about sign-in problems, technical issues, feedback, privacy questions or content concerns. We aim to respond to support and privacy inquiries within two business days. Business days are Monday to Friday, excluding public holidays observed in Puerto Rico. Requests that need investigation may take longer to resolve. Our mailing address: VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><p>Include the app version, your device and its operating system version, and what happened. Add your workspace name if we need it to find the problem. Remove personal information from screenshots. <strong>Never email your password, a verification code, bank details or payroll documents.</strong></p></section><section id="p-1"><i>02</i><h2>Questions about your work</h2><p>Ask your manager or workplace administrator about shifts, time-off decisions, pay or corrections to your work records. Contact NEVORA support if a problem in the app stops you from reaching them.</p></section><section id="p-2"><i>03</i><h2>Signing in</h2><p>Each workplace has its own NEVORA sign-in address, which your employer gives you; there is no shared NEVORA login. Sign in with your Employee ID and password, or with a passkey or Face ID where offered. New employees activate their account from the invitation email their employer sends. No invitation? Ask your Owner.</p><p>Forgot your password? Use <strong>Forgot access</strong> on the sign-in page. If you no longer have the email address on your account, ask your manager or Owner: they can verify you and give you a recovery code. We will never ask for your password or a verification code by email.</p></section><section id="p-3"><i>04</i><h2>Privacy and account deletion</h2><p>Read our <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">Privacy Policy</a>, or see <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-account-deletion{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-account-deletion{% endif %}">Account deletion</a> to start a request. You can do it on the web without the app.</p></section><section id="p-4"><i>05</i><h2>Reporting content</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> with a short description of the item and where it appears, without unnecessary personal information.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact page</a></div></div></div></div></section>
